# LineLoom v1.1.1: one-time GitHub pre-release trigger

Channel: GitHub pre-release ONLY (stable v1.0.0 unchanged).
Expected version: 1.1.1; publisher: SanskarCodes.
Release preparation: PR #25 (20 commits; Windows/macOS/Linux, mocked Ollama,
dependency audit, pre-release VSIX packaging and isolated CLI install passed).
Next planned stable: v1.2.0, after manual acceptance and independent registries.

Release workflow .github/workflows/release-v1.1.1.yml MUST run full validation,
reject duplicate tags/releases, build an actual pre-release-marked VSIX plus
SHA-256, and publish --prerelease --latest=false.
This flag must not trigger Marketplace or Open VSX publishing.
